  "bodyHash": "ec0e22675da9028c",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神秘灯笼让你能够运用光芒的力量！使用灯笼制造器制作具有各种特殊效果的灯笼，为你的基地提供帮助。还等什么，准备好迎接魔法吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用灯笼制造器将普通的原版灯笼注入特殊能力。将催化剂放置在制造器上，最后将原版灯笼方块放在顶部，即可创造出你的新灯笼。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每种灯笼的合成配方和信息可以在 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">JEI</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">REI</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 中查看。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生命灯笼：使周围作物生长速度加快。催化剂：鸡蛋、西瓜、金苹果、甘蔗、骨粉</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">荒野灯笼：通过生成火花照亮周围大片区域。当区域被点亮且生成的火花足够多时，灯笼会消失。催化剂：萤石、南瓜灯、火焰弹、烈焰粉、金锭</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">爱情灯笼：使附近生物进入求偶状态。催化剂：钻石、兔子脚、金胡萝卜、甜菜根、生命灯笼、蜂蜜瓶</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哀嚎灯笼：当你靠近时会哭泣，当你更靠近时会尖叫并施加反胃效果。催化剂：恶魂之泪、缠绕根须、燧石、河豚、墨囊</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">极地灯笼：减缓附近生物和玩家的速度，并熄灭燃烧的生物。催化剂：蜘蛛网、雪球、冰砖、石英</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">光辉灯笼：直接将附近的动物转化为经验值。催化剂：潜影贝壳、纸、雪球、幻翼膜</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">守护灯笼：将除玩家以外的所有实体推开。催化剂：诡异菌、河豚、铁门、黑曜石</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> containment 灯笼：将除玩家以外的所有实体限制在特定区域内。催化剂：守护灯笼、钓鱼竿、蜘蛛网、锁链</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零灯笼：在其周围区域施加凋零效果。催化剂：凋谢玫瑰、灵魂沙、烟花之星、煤炭</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">云雾灯笼：在其周围区域施加缓慢坠落效果。催化剂：幻翼膜、灵魂火把、雪块、白色羊毛</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端必须安装 &amp; 服务端必须安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Fabric &amp; NeoForge)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持配置，可以通过游戏内的模组菜单直接进行配置（在 Fabric 上需要安装由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 开发的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需要安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有配置文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都存在，甚至可能完全没有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Playelectro\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Playelectro</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 最初制作了这个模组，当时名为 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magical-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Magical Lanterns</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。神秘灯笼是一个移植到现代 Minecraft 的版本，包含许多小改进、修复和重构。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sheep-variety\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sheepvariety/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stylisheffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mobplaques/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
